ManimGL is the animation engine Grant Sanderson (3Blue1Brown) uses for
his explanatory math videos.  Scenes are Python classes that create
mathematical objects (shapes, graphs, LaTeX formulas, Pango text, 3D
surfaces) and animate them; manimgl previews a scene interactively in a
window or writes it to a video file.  This version renders with WebGPU
(wgpu-py and wgpu-native: Metal on macOS, Vulkan elsewhere).
